  }))), "Human Response"), mdx("p", null, "My experience with the HuggingFace SmolLM3-3B model was overall a positive experience. The model appears to easily comprehend my complex questions and prompts in a very efficient and complete manner and had a chat interface on the HuggingChat platform that felt similar to large-scale closed-weight LLMs such as ChatGPT, Grok, or Gemini. Despite a great experience, a few minor challenges still existed."), mdx("p", null, "The first issue was less about the model and more about the HuggingChat platform. Since the model is trained to only comprehend text, the model initially could not process a raw PDF for the paper. Instead the PDF had to be converted to a text only format which was a concern for whether contents of the paper would render correctly leading the model to misinterpret or hallucinate information. "), mdx("p", null, "Aside from the more platform specific issue, the only challenges faced with the model were largely around the framing of its answers to my questions. The answers themselves were of high quality but often overly verbose and lengthy when much less could be used. Despite prompts to keep the response to only a few sentences, the model often opted to create a multi-bullet output in which each bullet was a sentence or two. This format was helpful for gathering the individual components of the paper, but not in a very concise format that may be easier to grasp the general concepts with. "), mdx("br", null), mdx("br", null), mdx("h4", {
